{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00168",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.24,
      "end_seconds": 4.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Excuse me, doctor, should I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.31,
      "end_seconds": 8.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "You're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.95,
      "end_seconds": 13.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "So, I've been feeling faint, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.7,
      "end_seconds": 16.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.04,
      "end_seconds": 25.2,
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "text": "Okay, so it's been going on for two days. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.23,
      "end_seconds": 36.63,
      "duration_seconds": 10.4,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps. Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.06,
      "end_seconds": 53.41,
      "duration_seconds": 15.35,
      "text": "I notice it more with standing in the sun. I'd give it a eight, out of ten. I'd say a few times a day. Sitting in the shade helps a bit. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.45,
      "end_seconds": 57.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.71,
      "end_seconds": 81.38,
      "duration_seconds": 22.67,
      "text": "It usually comes with heavy sweating. The heavy sweating? That's been for ten days. About heavy sweating, honestly, a few times a day. As for nausea, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. I've had a pounding headache too, for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.83,
      "end_seconds": 85.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.54,
      "end_seconds": 90.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I mean, yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.4,
      "end_seconds": 93.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Any vomiting, fainting or confusion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.66,
      "end_seconds": 96.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.86,
      "end_seconds": 98.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Has there been any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.25,
      "end_seconds": 101.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.06,
      "end_seconds": 104.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.21,
      "end_seconds": 106.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.79,
      "end_seconds": 111.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.21,
      "end_seconds": 116.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "My father had a stroke. My father had kidney stones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.47,
      "end_seconds": 120.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.58,
      "end_seconds": 121.29,
      "duration_seconds": 0.71,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.39,
      "end_seconds": 136.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.81,
      "end_seconds": 147.6,
      "duration_seconds": 9.79,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me. An underactive thyroid, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.66,
      "end_seconds": 175.74,
      "duration_seconds": 27.08,
      "text": "Right. Yes, I can see the high blood pressure in your file as well. Okay, an underactive thyroid, that's already on your record. Good to know. I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.87,
      "end_seconds": 180.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.36,
      "end_seconds": 186.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.66,
      "end_seconds": 189.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Okay, so not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.23,
      "end_seconds": 196.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.27,
      "end_seconds": 200.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "It's amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.53,
      "end_seconds": 205.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.46,
      "end_seconds": 218.41,
      "duration_seconds": 11.95,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.18,
      "end_seconds": 221.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.83,
      "end_seconds": 236.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.97,
      "end_seconds": 263.0,
      "duration_seconds": 11.03,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 102, temperature is 37.2 degrees, saturation 99 percent, blood pressure 97 over 59. Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.34,
      "end_seconds": 274.78,
      "duration_seconds": 10.44,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.41,
      "end_seconds": 278.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.45,
      "end_seconds": 282.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.17,
      "end_seconds": 291.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Capillary refill is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.88,
      "end_seconds": 294.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.59,
      "end_seconds": 304.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Your skin is warm and a bit clammy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.41,
      "end_seconds": 315.49,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.92,
      "end_seconds": 321.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.68,
      "end_seconds": 322.58,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.83,
      "end_seconds": 346.13,
      "duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is heat exhaustion with some dehydration. I'd also keep an electrolyte imbalance in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.97,
      "end_seconds": 348.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.12,
      "end_seconds": 364.09,
      "duration_seconds": 14.97,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with heat exhaustion with some dehydration do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling faint for two days, and no confusion or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.4,
      "end_seconds": 365.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.49,
      "end_seconds": 369.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.92,
      "end_seconds": 372.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.88,
      "end_seconds": 375.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "I'm going to order blood salts, for dehydration."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 376.25,
      "end_seconds": 379.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "I can book that for Monday at 2 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 380.66,
      "end_seconds": 381.51,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.6,
      "end_seconds": 394.55,
      "duration_seconds": 11.95,
      "text": "I'll start you on ORS, 1 sachet, three times a day, for two days. You take it by mouth. It's for dehydration. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 396.02,
      "end_seconds": 396.89,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.35,
      "end_seconds": 416.44,
      "duration_seconds": 19.09,
      "text": "Avoid the midday sun for a few days and keep a water bottle with you. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. If you become confused or stop sweating, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 417.88,
      "end_seconds": 419.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.35,
      "end_seconds": 423.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 423.8,
      "end_seconds": 425.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 426.68,
      "end_seconds": 431.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 435.45,
      "end_seconds": 439.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "So, I come back in three days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 440.92,
      "end_seconds": 445.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 446.33,
      "end_seconds": 449.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    }
  ]
}